{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Elian was a magnificent Alopius, a winged horse with the strength of a lion and the agility of an eagle. With feathers as white as snow and a mane that shone like gold, Elian was a creature of legend. He was born from the dreams of the ancient gods and was said to possess the power to heal the wounded and protect the innocent. Elian's wingspan was so vast that he could block out the sun, and his hooves could strike the earth with the force of thunder. He roamed the skies, watching over the land and its inhabitants, ever vigilant and always ready to defend those who needed his aid. Elian's wisdom and kindness earned him the reverence of all who knew him, and his name became synonymous with courage and protection.",
